## Screenshots / notes for reviewers

Data sources: OSRS Wiki: Hunters' Rumours (list of rumours and its notes, rates and pity, turn-in XP, rules), Basic quetzal whistle, Goat hunting ("one of its hooves"), Transcript: Huntmaster Gilman (Novice), Guild Hunter Cervus/Ornus (Adept), Aco/Teco (Expert), Wolf (Master), Guild Scribe Verity. Quest keys `quest_eaglespeak` and `quest_bonevoyage` are the cache dbrows.

Caveats:
- Under the default assume-completed quest mode the quest requirements count as met.
- Guesses: the wagtail and herbiboar part wordings, the pity reset on a new rumour, the part rolling on Check, the no-rumour whistle message, the level line for hunters other than Wolf, the nothing-to-offer line, Gilman's Yes/No switch without an old rumour, the back-to-back rule.
- Not done: guild hunter outfit pity, loot sacks opening, milestone unlocks, Wolf's At First Light requirement, Verity's spare-gear trade, the "intel reshuffle" lines, rumours for creatures the server can't catch.

